WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:40.950 --> 01:42.570
I'm Youqin Xuanya of Ascendance Sect.

01:42.590 --> 01:44.330
Please instruct me, seniors.

02:03.510 --> 02:05.690
Of all in the outer hall
not in the Register,

02:05.710 --> 02:06.980
only this one remains.

02:07.640 --> 02:09.410
It must be the Inner Treasury entrance.

02:12.430 --> 02:13.220
No.

02:13.960 --> 02:15.340
Since there are guards,

02:15.710 --> 02:17.610
there must be
a mechanism restriction too.

02:19.150 --> 02:21.340
To be safe, I'll come back next time.

02:26.840 --> 02:28.220
You're from Ascendance Sect,

02:28.840 --> 02:30.220
yet you don't use magic?

02:35.120 --> 02:36.260
I have my reasons.

02:36.630 --> 02:38.130
Please forgive us, seniors.

02:38.360 --> 02:39.130
How annoying.

02:40.240 --> 02:41.820
She's still respecting us now.

02:45.310 --> 02:46.980
It's just a few immortal treasures.

02:47.000 --> 02:48.220
Let's just go easy on her.

02:50.030 --> 02:51.010
We can go easy on her,

02:51.030 --> 02:52.820
but will His Highness do the same to us?

02:56.910 --> 02:58.220
We'll only use 20% of our power.

02:58.630 --> 03:00.130
It all depends on your luck.

03:17.380 --> 03:20.300
[Episode 8]

03:21.360 --> 03:22.170
Xuanya.

03:22.910 --> 03:23.820
Elder Kuai.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.610
It's already this intense.

03:26.030 --> 03:27.100
Aren't you going to help her?

03:27.120 --> 03:28.730
Yes, go help her, quick.

03:29.590 --> 03:30.450
Your Highness,

03:30.710 --> 03:33.220
Kuai Si is too humiliated to hold on.

03:34.360 --> 03:35.450
You have a point.

03:36.030 --> 03:37.450
Don't say it so loud.

03:41.120 --> 03:42.130
What a hassle.

03:55.360 --> 03:56.660
- How? - Beautiful!
- Xuanya is amazing!

03:56.680 --> 03:57.890
- Senior is formidable!
- Xuanya is amazing!

03:58.430 --> 03:59.130
Call a few people.

03:59.150 --> 04:00.450
Let them beat that girl out!

04:02.080 --> 04:03.690
That's not what you said earlier!

04:03.710 --> 04:05.380
Your Highness, His Majesty has ordered.

04:05.400 --> 04:06.570
Even if we are
to humiliate the Human Clan,

04:06.590 --> 04:07.610
it must be done by proper means.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.980
We can't give them
any excuse for trouble.

04:13.750 --> 04:14.730
Someone helped me!

04:18.630 --> 04:20.170
Why are you hitting me?

04:20.190 --> 04:21.580
Then why are you hitting me?

04:21.830 --> 04:22.610
Move!

04:23.000 --> 04:23.780
Xuanya.

04:24.160 --> 04:25.340
Are you all right?

04:26.000 --> 04:27.700
- Great!
- No worries.

04:28.270 --> 04:28.980
Awesome!

04:29.000 --> 04:30.140
Senior, I...

04:30.160 --> 04:31.460
I've got them all.

04:34.120 --> 04:34.980
First Prince,

04:35.240 --> 04:35.660
in that case...

04:35.680 --> 04:36.140
Very impressive.

04:36.160 --> 04:37.020
Does that count as my win?

04:44.240 --> 04:45.170
You are hard to finish off.

04:45.430 --> 04:46.410
You pass.

04:46.830 --> 04:47.660
As for what's inside,

04:49.120 --> 04:49.490
pick anything you like.

04:49.510 --> 04:50.490
Your Highness.

04:51.560 --> 04:52.170
Your Highness.

04:52.510 --> 04:53.220
What is happening?

04:53.750 --> 04:54.540
She...

04:55.040 --> 04:56.340
She comes with ill intent.

05:03.920 --> 05:04.730
This Resonance...

05:05.000 --> 05:05.780
What?

05:05.830 --> 05:06.610
It's her.

05:08.040 --> 05:09.340
Stop pulling. It hurts!

05:10.000 --> 05:10.900
Stop pulling me.

05:11.360 --> 05:12.250
Who goes there?

05:12.750 --> 05:15.250
You are in East Sea. Show yourself.

05:15.830 --> 05:18.370
Or we shall draw you out.

05:28.600 --> 05:29.730
A fine offering.

05:30.190 --> 05:31.460
Ugly indeed.

05:40.560 --> 05:41.340
This...

05:42.040 --> 05:43.290
Ascendance Sect disciples, heed me.

05:43.310 --> 05:45.220
This is the Dragon Palace's business.

05:45.240 --> 05:46.370
Everyone, fall back.

05:46.390 --> 05:47.100
Back!

05:50.830 --> 05:51.610
Ow! Ow!

05:51.830 --> 05:52.850
What are you doing?

05:53.630 --> 05:55.780
All units, send two more teams!

06:02.920 --> 06:03.780
Primordial...

06:03.800 --> 06:04.980
Primordial Vessel!

06:05.000 --> 06:06.930
Could she be Fairy Yunxiao

06:06.950 --> 06:08.290
of Jadecourt Palace, Trifairy Isle,

06:08.310 --> 06:10.610
disciple of Heavenreach Master,
foremost of the Seizing Sect?

06:11.190 --> 06:12.810
Fairy Yunxiao.

06:13.720 --> 06:14.490
You know her?

06:14.510 --> 06:15.290
A little.

06:20.750 --> 06:21.540
Fairy,

06:21.830 --> 06:23.460
I failed to recognize your greatness.

06:23.870 --> 06:25.020
Forgive my lack of proper welcome.

06:25.040 --> 06:26.170
Here, I offer...

06:29.510 --> 06:31.930
Let the East Sea master speak with me.

06:32.630 --> 06:33.810
Sure.

06:35.160 --> 06:36.370
Dear Fairy.

06:36.430 --> 06:37.980
You've come at last!

06:38.670 --> 06:39.830
His Majesty is here!

06:39.830 --> 06:41.030
- His Majesty!
- Fairy!

06:41.030 --> 06:42.540
You've come at last!

06:43.830 --> 06:45.170
This is the Dragon King?

06:45.190 --> 06:47.410
Why does he look so sleazy?

06:47.430 --> 06:48.700
You can tell at a glance

06:48.720 --> 06:49.810
that he's a lecherous dragon.

06:51.190 --> 06:53.250
The Trifairy Isle is near the sea.

06:53.360 --> 06:55.050
We've been good neighbors for years.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.810
Fairy, what took you so long?

06:56.830 --> 07:00.170
I've been waiting for you!

07:00.830 --> 07:02.250
I came uninvited.

07:02.600 --> 07:04.250
I hope I didn't disturb your rest.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.140
This...

07:08.390 --> 07:09.810
You're too kind.

07:10.070 --> 07:10.980
A celestial being graces us.

07:11.240 --> 07:13.220
Our humble home shines bright.

07:13.510 --> 07:15.410
Might I inquire what matter

07:15.430 --> 07:18.340
brings you all this way?

07:18.830 --> 07:20.610
I know the Dragon Palace
is rich in treasures,

07:21.190 --> 07:22.250
so I'm here

07:22.920 --> 07:24.610
to borrow a treasure from you.

07:24.630 --> 07:26.810
Of course!
We've been neighbors for years.

07:27.000 --> 07:28.980
Take whatever you wish.

07:29.000 --> 07:29.610
Attendant!

07:29.630 --> 07:31.410
Escort the Fairy to Lotus Hall.

07:31.430 --> 07:33.020
Let her choose freely.

07:33.270 --> 07:34.700
But the treasure I need

07:34.720 --> 07:35.980
may not be there.

07:37.950 --> 07:40.660
What treasure do you have in mind?

07:41.430 --> 07:42.660
The Sea-Calming Pillar.

07:45.430 --> 07:46.410
The Sea-Calming Pillar?

07:46.600 --> 07:47.410
What?

07:51.070 --> 07:51.930
How dare you!

07:51.950 --> 07:54.140
The Sea-Calming Pillar is
our greatest treasure.

07:54.160 --> 07:55.220
You can't just demand to borrow it.

07:55.240 --> 07:55.980
Jia.

07:57.120 --> 07:58.850
Why get so worked up?

07:59.430 --> 08:01.540
Since you've spoken,

08:02.240 --> 08:04.660
you must be determined to have it.

08:05.510 --> 08:07.410
But as they say,

08:07.600 --> 08:10.340
skilled riders fall;
good swimmers drown.

08:11.310 --> 08:12.370
Fairy,

08:12.950 --> 08:14.610
please think carefully.

08:15.360 --> 08:16.980
I've always been reckless.

08:17.390 --> 08:20.660
I love to charge against the waves.

08:21.950 --> 08:22.730
Tomorrow,

08:24.190 --> 08:26.980
I'll give it to you as you wish.

08:27.240 --> 08:29.850
But please grant me one more night.

08:30.120 --> 08:31.290
The treasure's movement

08:31.310 --> 08:33.610
requires fasting,
purification, and rites.

08:33.750 --> 08:34.850
Tomorrow morning,

08:34.960 --> 08:37.820
I'll present the treasure. How's that?

08:42.870 --> 08:43.940
Block me.

08:45.030 --> 08:46.180
Hi, hi.

08:49.550 --> 08:50.770
You know each other?

09:00.000 --> 09:02.010
I heard that lately,

09:03.030 --> 09:04.420
Fairy Yunxiao

09:05.120 --> 09:09.010
started asking
about the Sea-Calming Pillar.

09:09.240 --> 09:10.980
Ten from Ascendance Sect,

09:11.240 --> 09:12.610
one Dragon Clan General.

09:12.790 --> 09:13.980
So, the total should be...

09:14.000 --> 09:14.820
Eleven.

09:15.200 --> 09:16.580
It should be eleven people,

09:17.240 --> 09:19.820
but there are twelve spiritual senses.

09:24.150 --> 09:24.940
Come in.

09:27.480 --> 09:28.250
Senior.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.370
Here to get gifts?

09:40.000 --> 09:40.850
So many?

09:42.200 --> 09:44.060
One means a thousand times.

09:46.390 --> 09:47.820
Never mind a thousand times.

09:48.360 --> 09:49.770
Ten thousand times is worth it.

09:53.240 --> 09:55.420
There are so many treasures here.

09:59.600 --> 10:01.060
How is Junior Xuanya?

10:03.000 --> 10:04.770
She's fine. She's already lain down.

10:08.630 --> 10:09.420
Senior,

10:10.000 --> 10:11.820
was it you who saved

10:11.840 --> 10:13.130
Senior Xuanya inside today?

10:13.150 --> 10:13.580
Yes.

10:15.630 --> 10:16.820
I knew it!

10:17.120 --> 10:18.940
Why did you insist on Lotus Hall today?

10:18.960 --> 10:21.130
It must be for her, right?

10:21.390 --> 10:23.340
Wrong answer. Add two thousand more.

10:24.000 --> 10:25.010
I just knew it.

10:25.030 --> 10:26.770
How could you be thinking
of someone else?

10:26.790 --> 10:28.650
It must be me!

10:29.600 --> 10:31.340
Wrong answer.
Add another two thousand.

10:33.030 --> 10:34.220
Then what is it really for?

10:37.030 --> 10:39.220
Fairy Yunxiao at the hall today...

10:39.670 --> 10:41.010
What about her?

10:42.120 --> 10:43.770
She went to borrow
the Sea-Calming Pillar.

10:44.750 --> 10:46.490
But she said she knew the Pillar

10:46.510 --> 10:47.820
wasn't in the Lotus Hall.

10:48.440 --> 10:49.980
How did she know that?

10:50.200 --> 10:51.250
Since she knew

10:51.270 --> 10:52.580
the Pillar was not in Lotus Hall,

10:52.600 --> 10:54.610
why did she storm Lotus Hall then?

10:55.360 --> 10:56.100
Senior,

10:56.120 --> 10:57.940
she's an immortal of the Seizing Sect.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.770
Her cultivation
surpasses our Grandlord's.

10:59.790 --> 11:01.220
Why should I care about that?

11:04.960 --> 11:05.730
A divine lamp.

11:07.670 --> 11:09.220
I'm not after some treasure.

11:10.720 --> 11:11.490
I'm after a person.

11:12.360 --> 11:13.130
No.

11:14.960 --> 11:17.220
She wasn't there for the Pillar.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.340
Then what was she there for?

11:19.630 --> 11:21.580
She came to let me know she's here.

11:25.510 --> 11:26.530
She wants to see me.

11:35.840 --> 11:37.420
Here.

11:39.390 --> 11:40.220
Be gentle.

11:40.550 --> 11:41.340
Sure.

11:50.150 --> 11:51.460
Time to look inside.

11:52.030 --> 11:52.890
Whose turn is it?

11:52.910 --> 11:54.340
I just went. Now, it's your turn.

11:54.360 --> 11:56.820
I just went. It's your turn.

11:56.840 --> 11:58.820
Nonsense. Who went just now?

11:58.840 --> 12:00.010
I did.

12:00.030 --> 12:00.580
Go.

12:00.600 --> 12:01.890
You forgot. It must be you who forgot.

12:01.910 --> 12:02.700
Quick, quick. You go.

12:02.720 --> 12:03.340
You go.

12:03.360 --> 12:03.980
From your first day here,

12:04.000 --> 12:04.460
you've been slacking off.

12:04.480 --> 12:05.820
- Will you go or not?
- Hurry up.

12:06.840 --> 12:07.610
What are you looking at?

12:10.440 --> 12:11.180
Who are you?

12:11.200 --> 12:13.010
Two handsome gentlemen, I'm...

12:13.790 --> 12:14.580
a lobster.

12:14.600 --> 12:16.340
I'm here for lost

12:16.360 --> 12:16.980
and found.

12:18.030 --> 12:18.850
Take a look. Take a look.

12:19.320 --> 12:20.730
Does this belong to either of you?

12:21.540 --> 12:22.500
[Beauty Portrait]

12:26.600 --> 12:27.420
Stop shaking it.

12:28.910 --> 12:29.850
Is it? Is it?

12:30.200 --> 12:30.940
[Beauty Portrait]
No, no!

12:30.960 --> 12:32.180
We're not that kind of men.

12:32.200 --> 12:32.820
Take it away.

12:32.840 --> 12:33.490
No, no!

12:33.510 --> 12:34.850
I have another one here.

12:38.030 --> 12:39.700
A true treasure. A treasure!

12:40.240 --> 12:41.180
How is it?

13:08.440 --> 13:09.420
Here I come.

13:34.910 --> 13:35.730
Indeed.

13:53.030 --> 13:54.340
Leaving in such a hurry?

13:56.790 --> 13:58.010
Put me down!

14:00.120 --> 14:00.820
A thief!

14:05.870 --> 14:06.420
Well, well.

14:06.440 --> 14:07.770
Miss, I'm afraid of heights!

14:07.790 --> 14:08.940
Please put me down.

14:10.670 --> 14:11.370
Miss.

14:11.910 --> 14:13.370
This treasure is quite intriguing.

14:13.630 --> 14:14.490
Little girl,

14:14.910 --> 14:16.060
who sent you?

14:17.390 --> 14:18.010
Well...

14:18.120 --> 14:19.770
Miss, you've misunderstood.

14:19.840 --> 14:21.820
I'm just lost, you see.

14:22.000 --> 14:23.220
Which way to the latrine?

14:24.150 --> 14:25.220
I'll take you there.

14:25.440 --> 14:26.010
Miss,

14:26.030 --> 14:27.220
put me down first, okay?

14:27.240 --> 14:28.340
Put me down, and we'll talk.

14:28.390 --> 14:29.340
In your dreams.

14:30.750 --> 14:32.220
Who's this thief stealing treasure?

14:34.240 --> 14:35.610
Oh, it's the Fairy.

14:35.750 --> 14:36.730
Thank you for your trouble, Fairy.

14:36.750 --> 14:37.940
If not for you, Fairy,

14:37.960 --> 14:39.820
this thief would have slipped through.

14:40.030 --> 14:41.420
It was nothing.

14:42.320 --> 14:44.180
Fairy, you must be startled.

14:44.240 --> 14:46.180
I can handle this.

14:46.440 --> 14:48.220
I have eighty ways to kill her.

14:48.240 --> 14:48.890
Let me.

14:48.910 --> 14:50.770
I will stay here tonight.

14:52.750 --> 14:53.300
Then...

14:54.000 --> 14:55.420
Fairy, make yourself at home.

15:02.910 --> 15:04.250
How cruel of you.

15:04.550 --> 15:06.610
A true heir of Ascendance Sect.

15:07.200 --> 15:07.980
Flowing wind, moistening water.

15:08.000 --> 15:08.730
Silence.

15:14.360 --> 15:16.010
For you, chant-bound spells

15:16.030 --> 15:17.370
show far too little cultivation.

15:18.510 --> 15:20.610
Your cultivation is far beyond this.

15:24.240 --> 15:25.460
Fairy, you know me?

15:26.390 --> 15:27.420
Kuru Land.

15:27.910 --> 15:29.820
Thanks for securing Skyscraping Vine.

15:30.440 --> 15:31.220
Not at all.

15:31.240 --> 15:33.010
Fairy, you like plants too?

15:33.030 --> 15:35.340
Skyscraping Vine can reach the heavens.

15:36.000 --> 15:37.420
But the place I must go

15:37.840 --> 15:39.220
is beyond even Skyscraping Vine.

15:39.600 --> 15:41.340
You're a mere Human Clan disciple.

15:41.600 --> 15:43.010
Why do you need Skyscraping Vine?

15:43.910 --> 15:44.940
Here's the thing.

15:45.030 --> 15:46.610
My place was just redone.

15:46.630 --> 15:48.250
I need a few to clear the smell.

15:54.000 --> 15:55.460
You like crafts too?

15:57.120 --> 15:58.650
These scouts are handy indeed.

16:00.150 --> 16:01.610
You put much thought into them.

16:01.910 --> 16:04.610
I came to the East Sea to scout it.

16:05.120 --> 16:06.010
But then I found

16:06.030 --> 16:07.980
many paper butterflies already set.

16:08.600 --> 16:11.010
That person must know the East Sea

16:11.120 --> 16:12.730
like the back of their hand.

16:13.240 --> 16:14.130
That impressive?

16:14.840 --> 16:16.580
Why not ask him, Fairy?

16:18.240 --> 16:20.370
I know not who set them.

16:20.960 --> 16:21.980
But I do know

16:22.360 --> 16:23.420
that if I show myself,

16:23.790 --> 16:25.220
they will come to me,

16:25.550 --> 16:27.420
for we seek the same thing.

16:28.390 --> 16:29.980
So, you stirred things up

16:30.000 --> 16:31.180
at Lotus Hall?

16:31.200 --> 16:32.460
I chose Lotus Hall

16:32.910 --> 16:34.650
because everyone was there,

16:35.840 --> 16:36.770
including you.

16:37.790 --> 16:40.010
The moment I saw you, I knew

16:40.600 --> 16:43.580
the paper butterflies must be your work.

16:44.550 --> 16:46.340
How could you be certain?

16:46.360 --> 16:47.460
In Kuru Land,

16:48.000 --> 16:49.820
I've already seen your methods.

16:55.840 --> 16:56.610
So,

16:57.200 --> 16:58.850
you're here to interrogate me

16:59.000 --> 17:00.220
for the Sea-Calming Pillar?

17:00.240 --> 17:01.460
If you're willing to tell me,

17:02.030 --> 17:04.050
we could save a lot of time.

17:04.510 --> 17:06.250
If you want to know,
I'll certainly tell you.

17:06.440 --> 17:08.140
Actually, this Sea-Calming Pillar...

17:08.440 --> 17:09.220
It...

17:11.110 --> 17:11.980
Now!

17:15.110 --> 17:16.090
Fairy, take care.

17:20.400 --> 17:21.460
Thank you, Fairy.

17:22.790 --> 17:24.380
A mere mechanism restriction.

17:24.550 --> 17:26.220
You used me to open the door on purpose.

17:26.350 --> 17:28.620
Things are tough now.
I have to go with the flow.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.420
According to the map,

17:30.590 --> 17:32.250
that thing should be nearby.

17:42.060 --> 17:45.020
[By Grand Mage,
Sea-Calming Pillar Diagram]

17:46.720 --> 17:47.460
Here it is.

17:52.310 --> 17:52.940
Well done.

17:53.350 --> 17:54.730
You used me to avoid the traps.

17:54.960 --> 17:56.140
I used you to steal the item.

17:56.400 --> 17:57.620
We're even.

17:57.790 --> 17:58.700
What a surprise.

17:59.590 --> 18:00.900
I thought I had it all planned.

18:01.270 --> 18:04.090
Yet your power trumps all.

18:04.680 --> 18:06.010
Still not steady enough.

18:06.200 --> 18:06.980
Wrong.

18:07.830 --> 18:08.460
You lose

18:09.400 --> 18:10.940
precisely because you were too steady.

18:13.110 --> 18:14.180
Have you ever made a mistake?

18:14.720 --> 18:15.490
No.

18:15.680 --> 18:18.010
Have you ever dared to defy the world,

18:18.480 --> 18:20.490
bathe in blood, and risk it all?

18:21.200 --> 18:21.980
I...

18:22.000 --> 18:23.140
You certainly haven't.

18:23.680 --> 18:25.570
You're the kind I hate most.

18:26.030 --> 18:27.900
You always keep a way out for yourself,

18:27.920 --> 18:29.220
playing it safe.

18:29.400 --> 18:30.420
When it matters most,

18:30.880 --> 18:32.700
righteousness, rules,

18:33.790 --> 18:34.940
and even your comrades

18:35.510 --> 18:36.700
can be cast aside.

18:37.920 --> 18:38.700
Right?

18:39.640 --> 18:40.090
I...

18:41.160 --> 18:41.860
Giving it one's all

18:41.880 --> 18:43.810
is the greatest joy.

18:44.310 --> 18:45.570
You've never experienced it,

18:45.920 --> 18:48.290
so you won't understand my feelings.

18:53.790 --> 18:55.530
Fairy, Fairy.

18:55.590 --> 18:56.770
I'll confess everything.

18:57.240 --> 18:58.010
Actually,

18:58.920 --> 19:02.730
Junior and I have always been

19:03.160 --> 19:04.530
in love.

19:04.880 --> 19:07.290
Our private diary is in the treasury.

19:07.290 --> 19:09.750
[Yuan Qing, I miss you. Senior Kuai Si]

19:09.750 --> 19:10.770
[Junior Yuan Qing]
Her name is Yuan Qing?

19:11.590 --> 19:12.530
And you are Kuai Si?

19:12.550 --> 19:14.380
Yes. I am Kuai Si.

19:15.350 --> 19:16.940
I swear it here.

19:16.960 --> 19:19.180
If I lie, may I die wretchedly.

19:21.540 --> 19:23.340
[Kuai Si, love is now memory. Yuan Qing]

19:24.790 --> 19:26.010
You went to great trouble.

19:26.480 --> 19:29.420
Even the forgery looks flawless.

19:30.160 --> 19:30.980
However,

19:32.400 --> 19:33.530
my patience is gone.

19:33.550 --> 19:34.380
If you will not hand it over,

19:34.400 --> 19:35.180
I shall take it myself.

19:45.400 --> 19:46.660
The Sea-Calming Pillar

19:47.030 --> 19:47.980
is truly here.

19:50.030 --> 19:50.530
Did the Dragon King promise

19:50.550 --> 19:52.380
to give the Pillar to you?

19:52.640 --> 19:53.770
Had I believed him,

19:54.110 --> 19:55.530
why wait for you in Lotus Hall?

19:56.680 --> 19:57.900
If this map is real,

19:58.160 --> 19:59.570
to find the Sea-Calming Pillar,

19:59.920 --> 20:01.380
I must first locate the Eye of the Sea.

20:03.070 --> 20:04.180
So, where is the Eye of the Sea?

20:05.310 --> 20:06.810
How would I know?

20:06.920 --> 20:08.420
You've surveyed the East Sea's terrain.

20:08.480 --> 20:09.700
How could you not know where it is?

20:09.720 --> 20:10.380
Then...

20:10.960 --> 20:12.330
What if I'm just stupid?

20:14.880 --> 20:16.290
What will it take for you to tell me?

20:17.110 --> 20:18.620
Fairy, answer me a question first.

20:21.510 --> 20:22.330
Go on.

20:26.400 --> 20:28.380
Fairy, well...

20:29.590 --> 20:31.660
You followed us into the Dragon Palace

20:31.680 --> 20:33.380
and only revealed yourself today.

20:33.550 --> 20:34.860
There's only one explanation.

20:35.480 --> 20:38.380
You have someone inside, right?

20:39.510 --> 20:40.730
You guessed right.

20:42.110 --> 20:42.770
Who is it?

20:43.110 --> 20:44.140
I don't know.

20:44.200 --> 20:46.570
Then how did you contact them?

20:47.000 --> 20:48.530
Why did they send you here?

20:48.550 --> 20:50.180
And why should I tell you?

20:52.720 --> 20:53.490
Okay.

20:54.160 --> 20:55.140
To show my sincerity,

20:55.310 --> 20:57.770
I'll trade three secrets
of the Sea-Calming Pillar

20:57.790 --> 20:58.770
with you.

20:58.920 --> 20:59.700
Go on.

20:59.790 --> 21:01.010
Then I'll get up and tell you.

21:04.400 --> 21:05.900
The first secret:

21:06.070 --> 21:08.290
Though the Pillar's name

21:08.480 --> 21:09.620
contains the word "Pillar",

21:09.750 --> 21:10.490
actually, it's...

21:13.590 --> 21:15.330
Someone's in the way.

21:25.000 --> 21:26.290
But it's not a pillar.

21:28.550 --> 21:29.490
Then what is it?

21:30.590 --> 21:31.620
It's a kind

21:32.070 --> 21:34.290
of rod that holds up the sky.

21:34.960 --> 21:37.330
It links the heaven and sea.

21:37.480 --> 21:39.490
Though it can take the shape of a stick

21:39.510 --> 21:40.660
and an embroidery needle,

21:40.680 --> 21:42.700
yet it weighs 13,500 jin.

21:42.720 --> 21:44.900
Even all the guards of the Dragon Palace

21:44.920 --> 21:46.940
cannot budge it one bit.

21:46.960 --> 21:48.810
The Pillar hasn't been seen in ages.

21:49.070 --> 21:49.980
You've seen it?

21:50.960 --> 21:52.180
In a way, I have.

21:52.960 --> 21:54.530
Now, the second secret...

21:54.550 --> 21:56.530
I'm telling you this for your own good.

21:57.680 --> 22:00.530
The Pillar bears immense karma.

22:00.550 --> 22:01.810
It's not yours to bear.

22:01.960 --> 22:03.140
You couldn't endure it.

22:03.350 --> 22:04.620
How would you know that?

22:05.960 --> 22:07.940
The one who takes the Pillar

22:08.000 --> 22:09.660
will become an enemy
of the Celestial Realm,

22:09.680 --> 22:11.140
undergo the furnace refinement

22:11.160 --> 22:12.620
for 49 days,

22:12.680 --> 22:14.770
and be pinned
under a mountain for 500 years.

22:14.790 --> 22:16.380
Can you bear that karma?

22:16.510 --> 22:17.570
I'll know

22:17.720 --> 22:18.700
once I try.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.180
Fairy, don't be hasty.

22:20.790 --> 22:22.380
There's a third secret.

22:22.750 --> 22:23.940
There is a way

22:24.110 --> 22:26.140
to avoid the karma

22:26.160 --> 22:27.700
and still claim the Pillar.

22:28.590 --> 22:29.010
Tell me.

22:29.440 --> 22:30.810
Wait another thousand years.

22:31.720 --> 22:32.490
A thousand years later,

22:32.510 --> 22:34.380
a great immortal will pass by here

22:34.510 --> 22:36.090
and take the Pillar.

22:36.110 --> 22:37.730
He will defy the Celestial Realm

22:37.750 --> 22:39.090
and battle the celestial soldiers.

22:39.110 --> 22:40.770
Then, he'll be trapped

22:40.790 --> 22:42.420
under a mountain for 500 years.

22:42.440 --> 22:43.530
When he's trapped,

22:43.550 --> 22:44.700
you go find him

22:44.720 --> 22:46.220
and snatch the Pillar.

22:46.720 --> 22:47.900
Wouldn't that be perfect?

22:48.880 --> 22:51.620
How did the great immortal
get the Pillar?

22:52.270 --> 22:53.490
He'll shrink it to fit inside his ear.

22:54.720 --> 22:55.490
Who is he?

22:55.510 --> 22:56.220
He's not a human.

22:56.240 --> 22:57.090
He's a monkey.

22:58.030 --> 22:58.900
Where did he come from?

22:58.960 --> 23:00.180
He burst forth from a stone.

23:02.270 --> 23:03.420
You've got to be kidding me.

23:10.920 --> 23:11.700
When...

23:13.270 --> 23:14.290
You're stalling for time.

23:27.550 --> 23:28.250
Fairy,

23:28.720 --> 23:29.700
this blaze will draw

23:30.030 --> 23:31.860
the Dragon Palace army here soon.

23:31.880 --> 23:34.660
If you don't flee now,
you may never get the chance.

23:34.680 --> 23:35.660
To save your life,

23:35.830 --> 23:37.180
you went to great lengths
with this scheme.

23:38.550 --> 23:40.460
Trouble at Lotus Hall! Follow me!

23:47.000 --> 23:47.460
Move!

23:50.110 --> 23:50.900
What's going on?

23:51.920 --> 23:52.660
Frog!

23:52.680 --> 23:53.010
Eel!

23:53.030 --> 23:53.420
Wake up!

23:56.000 --> 23:56.460
Hurry.

23:57.000 --> 23:57.860
Fire!

23:59.110 --> 23:59.730
Go.

24:00.480 --> 24:02.570
Do you really think this could trap me?

24:03.720 --> 24:04.810
I underestimated you,

24:04.830 --> 24:05.620
but

24:05.830 --> 24:07.290
you underestimated me, too.

24:07.830 --> 24:09.420
Since I chose this path,

24:09.640 --> 24:11.010
even if I'm reduced to ashes,

24:11.440 --> 24:12.460
I will never retreat.

24:12.880 --> 24:13.220
I...

24:17.750 --> 24:19.530
Go put out the fire!

24:26.200 --> 24:27.620
It's you again, Yunxiao!

24:28.830 --> 24:31.490
We treated you with courtesy,
yet you set the house on fire!

24:36.590 --> 24:37.810
- After her!
- Hurry!

24:57.240 --> 24:58.420
You saved us?

25:00.270 --> 25:01.660
You broke into Lotus Hall at night.

25:02.160 --> 25:04.860
If the Dragon Palace learned,
it'd be dangerous, right?

25:06.480 --> 25:07.290
Why?

25:07.830 --> 25:09.380
You told me three secrets.

25:10.030 --> 25:11.420
Let me share one in return.

25:12.590 --> 25:13.980
Someone lured me to the East Sea,

25:14.960 --> 25:16.570
but I don't know who they were

25:17.110 --> 25:18.010
or what they looked like.

25:19.200 --> 25:20.220
Is that true?

25:21.440 --> 25:22.380
Who knows?

25:22.920 --> 25:24.140
Perhaps I'm lying to you too.

25:25.270 --> 25:26.380
If it is true,

25:27.640 --> 25:28.860
it must be a trap.

25:29.680 --> 25:30.460
I know.

25:31.030 --> 25:32.050
But I have no choice.

25:35.240 --> 25:36.010
Little brat,

25:36.440 --> 25:38.050
you and I are both at fate's mercy.

25:38.960 --> 25:40.180
Take care of yourself.

25:50.030 --> 25:52.010
Speak freely if you
have something to say.

25:57.830 --> 26:01.290
Fairy, why burn Lotus Hall?

26:01.480 --> 26:04.180
Must you meddle in all my affairs?

26:04.680 --> 26:05.770
Fairy,

26:06.400 --> 26:07.330
you don't want to say?

26:08.400 --> 26:10.140
Don't you claim to hear everything

26:10.440 --> 26:11.490
and know everything?

26:13.790 --> 26:15.090
Someone cast a spell,

26:15.550 --> 26:17.010
blocking my ears and eyes.

26:18.030 --> 26:19.010
So,

26:20.160 --> 26:21.620
your cultivation is lacking.

26:22.030 --> 26:23.050
What's that to me?

26:25.240 --> 26:27.140
Fairy, why go to Lotus Hall?

26:27.880 --> 26:29.810
Who was the person who spoke

26:30.440 --> 26:31.250
with you there?

26:32.030 --> 26:33.220
That's none of your concern.

26:34.350 --> 26:35.620
Fairy, don't forget:

26:36.640 --> 26:38.660
I brought you to the East Sea.

26:39.030 --> 26:40.460
Without my help,

26:41.720 --> 26:45.220
you'd be unable to move an inch.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.730
Unable to move an inch?

26:54.640 --> 26:55.980
Why don't you try?

26:59.440 --> 27:00.940
I helped you come to the East Sea.

27:01.830 --> 27:03.140
If you're hiding something,

27:04.030 --> 27:05.810
how can I offer all my help?

27:06.790 --> 27:07.860
Fairy, don't forget

27:08.830 --> 27:10.940
the Fated Mandate you bear.

27:22.110 --> 27:23.730
I'll go check the Sea-Calming Pillar.

27:28.880 --> 27:29.770
Did you find it?

27:30.350 --> 27:31.660
It's in the East Sea's forbidden zone.

27:32.640 --> 27:34.010
Fairy, you truly are amazing.

27:34.640 --> 27:37.530
I'm willing to guide you, Fairy.

27:50.160 --> 27:51.490
Who exactly are you?

27:52.030 --> 27:52.940
What are you plotting

27:53.400 --> 27:54.620
in helping me?

27:54.830 --> 27:56.420
Fairy, why ask so many questions?

27:57.440 --> 27:58.860
Even if it's a plot,

27:59.880 --> 28:01.420
you'll still go.

28:02.240 --> 28:03.770
Because, Fairy,

28:04.550 --> 28:05.940
you have no choice.

28:07.400 --> 28:10.220
The words are said; the way is shown.

28:10.880 --> 28:11.940
You can choose

28:12.750 --> 28:14.530
to believe it or not, Fairy.

28:21.920 --> 28:29.530
♪Birds in the trees fly in pairs♪

28:30.070 --> 28:31.980
I'll wrap more for you.

28:32.000 --> 28:34.810
That way you can't break up.

28:35.030 --> 28:37.220
Where is your true love?

28:38.270 --> 28:41.290
Let me look for your true love.

28:41.290 --> 28:43.660
[Li Changshou]

28:49.440 --> 28:51.010
Why is there an extra red thread?

28:51.960 --> 28:53.220
Where does this one connect to?

28:55.270 --> 28:57.330
Ah, Li Changshou.

28:57.830 --> 29:00.530
I wondered why you were
as stubborn as a rock.

29:00.960 --> 29:02.810
So, there's a new development.

29:02.830 --> 29:03.570
I've got to see

29:03.590 --> 29:05.770
where this red thread leads.

29:11.590 --> 29:13.010
Who's this?

29:13.350 --> 29:14.010
Moon Elder.

29:14.640 --> 29:15.420
Changshou?

29:16.440 --> 29:17.620
You're here to catch up
on sleep in your dreams?

29:17.640 --> 29:19.010
I've achieved a great feat.

29:19.030 --> 29:20.530
Please let me talk to your supervisor.

29:20.750 --> 29:21.180
You...

29:21.680 --> 29:22.810
You must be dreaming.

29:22.830 --> 29:23.770
How great?

29:23.830 --> 29:26.180
I'm not dreaming. That's a great feat.

29:28.480 --> 29:29.380
What did you say?

29:30.030 --> 29:31.570
Fairy Yunxiao went to the East Sea.

29:35.880 --> 29:36.810
Who are you?

29:37.070 --> 29:38.330
Where did you come from?

29:38.590 --> 29:40.220
A job seeker. He's called Changshou.

29:40.400 --> 29:41.570
I don't care about his name.

29:41.590 --> 29:43.050
Why did you bring him to me?

29:43.240 --> 29:44.900
Fairy Yunxiao's intrusion
into the Dragon Palace

29:44.920 --> 29:46.420
was for the Sea-Calming Pillar.

29:48.440 --> 29:50.220
How do you know about the Pillar?

29:50.240 --> 29:51.220
How do you know?

29:51.240 --> 29:51.490
This...

29:51.550 --> 29:53.220
When Fairy Yunxiao was at the East Sea,

29:53.240 --> 29:54.530
she told me herself.

29:54.750 --> 29:55.810
She told you herself?

29:56.480 --> 29:57.330
In that case,

29:58.510 --> 30:00.860
Fairy Yunxiao has already begun.

30:00.880 --> 30:02.010
Ah, yes.

30:02.240 --> 30:04.090
Upon hearing this,

30:04.110 --> 30:05.770
he swooshed up to the Celestial Court.

30:05.790 --> 30:07.050
That's a great feat indeed.

30:07.830 --> 30:09.810
Please send
the celestial soldiers at once.

30:09.830 --> 30:11.660
We must not let Fairy Yunxiao succeed.

30:12.590 --> 30:13.980
What do you know?

30:14.160 --> 30:16.420
You know how far it is to the East Sea?

30:16.440 --> 30:18.330
Even if I send
the celestial soldiers now,

30:18.350 --> 30:20.250
it will take time.

30:20.350 --> 30:21.620
It takes time, you know.

30:21.640 --> 30:23.180
My true body is in the East Sea.

30:23.200 --> 30:24.700
I'll serve the Celestial Court.

30:26.510 --> 30:27.810
You want to aid the Celestial Court?

30:27.830 --> 30:28.900
Look at yourself.

30:28.920 --> 30:30.250
Who are you? Where did you come from?

30:30.270 --> 30:31.620
Aren't you bragging a bit too much?

30:31.640 --> 30:32.980
I bet there's not a single bull left
in all the realms.

30:33.000 --> 30:34.380
You just bragged them all to death.

30:35.510 --> 30:38.330
I've clashed with Fairy Yunxiao once.

30:38.440 --> 30:40.090
Fairy Yunxiao is indeed powerful

30:40.110 --> 30:41.050
and clever.

30:41.070 --> 30:41.860
But I still believe

30:41.880 --> 30:43.940
I can stop this crisis

30:43.960 --> 30:45.290
and protect the Pillar.

30:45.310 --> 30:47.330
I can end the human-dragon feud

30:47.680 --> 30:49.620
and secure land for Celestial Court.

30:52.030 --> 30:53.290
Young man, those words...

30:53.310 --> 30:54.810
How should I describe this lad?

30:54.830 --> 30:55.290
This...

30:55.680 --> 30:56.330
How reliable.

31:05.830 --> 31:08.460
Fine. I think I understand.

31:08.790 --> 31:10.090
But I have to ask...

31:11.270 --> 31:12.050
You...

31:12.310 --> 31:14.010
Where does your confidence come from?

31:15.240 --> 31:17.180
I need only clarify one matter.

31:17.720 --> 31:19.050
Then I will have a plan.

31:23.240 --> 31:24.010
Reliable.

31:41.920 --> 31:42.530
Senior.

31:50.350 --> 31:53.250
Senior, you're finally awake.

31:53.270 --> 31:55.420
You've been out for ten years.

31:56.160 --> 31:57.180
Ten years?

31:57.640 --> 31:58.530
Then let me see your copies

31:58.550 --> 32:00.250
of the Scripture of Steadiness
during these ten years.

32:03.790 --> 32:05.860
So boring. You can't even pretend.

32:06.270 --> 32:07.570
Still cracking jokes.

32:07.920 --> 32:09.420
So, you're not too hurt.

32:11.640 --> 32:12.420
Not hurt?

32:13.270 --> 32:14.700
I'm not just not hurt.

32:14.750 --> 32:16.460
I'm bouncing with energy.

32:16.880 --> 32:19.010
Did Ms. Yunxiao casually heal me?

32:19.440 --> 32:20.620
Would she be that kind?

32:21.440 --> 32:22.940
I don't think she's a bad person.

32:22.960 --> 32:24.620
Yes, she doesn't seem like a bad person.

32:24.640 --> 32:26.010
She's simply not human.

32:26.830 --> 32:29.460
A Quasi-Saint, rare in this world.

32:31.680 --> 32:33.010
How do you know her name?

32:34.550 --> 32:35.460
When you were unconscious just now,

32:35.480 --> 32:36.810
you kept murmuring her name.

32:37.270 --> 32:40.090
Yunxiao, Yunxiao, Fairy...

32:40.110 --> 32:41.770
I was talking about Yunxiao...

32:41.790 --> 32:42.530
No, sweet dumplings.

32:42.550 --> 32:43.140
Yes.

32:43.160 --> 32:44.090
No, not important.

32:44.790 --> 32:46.090
We have more important things to do.

32:46.640 --> 32:47.420
What important things?

32:50.030 --> 32:52.660
Since these humans came here,

32:53.270 --> 32:55.290
there's trouble every day.

32:56.680 --> 32:58.860
They must be behind it.

32:59.640 --> 33:01.460
Don't let me catch them.

33:02.270 --> 33:03.050
Or else...

33:28.920 --> 33:31.860
How bold to steal treasures again!

33:39.880 --> 33:40.860
What do you want?

33:42.200 --> 33:44.010
How bold to steal treasures again!

33:44.030 --> 33:45.050
That's my line!

33:45.920 --> 33:47.090
The keys are in your hands.

33:47.110 --> 33:48.860
You even want to accuse us first?

33:48.920 --> 33:51.010
I have the keys; I can come and go.

33:51.030 --> 33:51.730
You admit it!

33:51.750 --> 33:52.730
You've confessed without being pressed.

33:52.750 --> 33:53.220
Confess?

33:53.240 --> 33:54.050
Confess what?

33:54.510 --> 33:56.570
Surprise!
A traitor in the Dragon Palace!

33:56.590 --> 33:57.220
Traitor?

33:57.240 --> 33:58.620
I'm no traitor!

33:58.640 --> 34:00.220
But Senior, if we say he's a traitor,

34:00.240 --> 34:01.770
will the First Prince believe us?

34:02.110 --> 34:03.290
Stop talking nonsense.

34:03.920 --> 34:06.180
Right, that's right.

34:06.240 --> 34:07.090
That's right.

34:07.110 --> 34:08.300
Mere talk won't do, of course.

34:08.320 --> 34:10.650
But we caught him red-handed.

34:13.630 --> 34:15.610
I have the keys; I can come and go.

34:16.070 --> 34:16.860
Give it to me!

34:17.920 --> 34:19.210
You think I won't kill you?

34:19.480 --> 34:21.010
You'd kill us?

34:21.510 --> 34:22.380
If you dare kill me,

34:22.400 --> 34:22.980
I'll take that

34:23.000 --> 34:23.900
and tell the First Prince.

34:23.920 --> 34:24.650
Do you believe me?

34:24.670 --> 34:25.530
Come on, kill me.

34:25.670 --> 34:25.940
Come on.

34:25.960 --> 34:26.980
Come on, kill me.

34:27.000 --> 34:28.010
Come on, kill me, then.

34:28.030 --> 34:28.460
Come on.

34:28.480 --> 34:29.010
You two...

34:31.440 --> 34:32.380
General,

34:32.550 --> 34:33.420
we look

34:33.440 --> 34:35.210
so upright and kind.

34:35.230 --> 34:36.940
Why would we harm you on purpose?

34:36.960 --> 34:38.380
We truly mean well.

34:38.550 --> 34:40.610
We just need a small favor.

34:40.670 --> 34:42.300
If you still refuse,

34:42.320 --> 34:43.050
then we

34:43.280 --> 34:45.570
must ruin your future.

34:45.760 --> 34:46.300
You two...

34:47.880 --> 34:48.980
Can we talk this over?

36:03.880 --> 36:04.650
Si'er,

36:05.510 --> 36:07.050
I searched East Palace for you.

36:07.800 --> 36:09.210
Why come to West Palace alone?

36:09.840 --> 36:11.420
Your Highness, why come here

36:12.030 --> 36:13.170
instead of sleeping?

36:13.920 --> 36:14.780
I'm bored.

36:17.710 --> 36:18.940
I was too harsh yesterday.

36:19.800 --> 36:20.940
So, I came to check

36:21.440 --> 36:22.610
whether you were hurt.

36:23.440 --> 36:25.340
You waited a day to check?

36:25.960 --> 36:26.740
I've been busy.

36:27.960 --> 36:29.900
Father put the humans in my charge.

36:30.110 --> 36:32.130
And Fairy Yunxiao showed up

36:32.400 --> 36:33.530
and burned my Lotus Hall.

36:34.190 --> 36:35.610
I was afraid you'd run into her

36:35.840 --> 36:36.650
and get hurt again.

36:39.190 --> 36:40.530
Thank you for your concern,
Your Highness.

36:41.630 --> 36:43.050
I am the Princess of the Mermaid Clan.

36:43.480 --> 36:44.420
If I really run into her,

36:44.880 --> 36:46.610
I won't be so easily harmed.

36:51.880 --> 36:52.650
Okay.

36:53.480 --> 36:54.380
It seems

36:54.840 --> 36:55.860
I worried too much.

36:57.030 --> 36:58.170
I was just being presumptuous.

36:59.190 --> 36:59.980
Your Highness.

37:05.630 --> 37:06.940
You care about me.

37:08.320 --> 37:09.610
I won't be ungrateful.

37:10.670 --> 37:11.460
I just wish

37:13.920 --> 37:16.420
you'd be the old you again.

37:17.670 --> 37:18.420
You used to be so...

37:18.440 --> 37:19.570
What was I like before?

37:19.590 --> 37:20.860
Why bring this up again?

37:21.070 --> 37:22.900
What of the past, and what of now?

37:22.920 --> 37:24.260
I am who I am.

37:26.190 --> 37:27.340
Ridiculous.

37:28.840 --> 37:29.610
Your Highness.

37:46.070 --> 37:46.940
Hurry up.

37:49.360 --> 37:51.380
Your Highness! This is urgent!

37:51.550 --> 37:53.010
Greetings, Crown Prince.

37:53.030 --> 37:54.050
Crown Prince.

37:54.150 --> 37:54.980
This is urgent.

37:56.030 --> 37:57.010
You brought them here?

37:58.800 --> 37:59.610
Turn around.

37:59.800 --> 38:00.530
Not again.

38:00.550 --> 38:01.420
You want to be kicked straight on?

38:04.590 --> 38:05.900
Who let you bring humans here?

38:05.920 --> 38:07.260
I can't stand the human smell.

38:07.440 --> 38:08.170
Crown Prince,

38:08.190 --> 38:09.780
study his rear in your chamber.

38:09.800 --> 38:11.090
The Dragon Palace is in trouble!

38:11.110 --> 38:12.610
Yes, yes, really in trouble.

38:12.710 --> 38:14.530
Audacious! You're the one in trouble.

38:14.710 --> 38:15.460
Really, really.

38:15.480 --> 38:16.340
Your Highness, there really is trouble.

38:16.360 --> 38:17.340
Really, really.

38:17.480 --> 38:20.050
This human cultivator
excels at divination.

38:20.150 --> 38:21.610
We'd better believe it's false.

38:22.440 --> 38:23.210
What?

38:23.920 --> 38:24.570
Believe what?

38:24.590 --> 38:25.900
Better to believe it's true.

38:26.070 --> 38:27.690
Right, don't believe it's true.

38:28.840 --> 38:30.420
What nonsense!

38:30.550 --> 38:31.090
I...

38:33.840 --> 38:35.940
Your Highness, I have a plan.

38:36.190 --> 38:37.460
It can save the East Sea

38:37.550 --> 38:39.740
and make you a great hero.

38:40.030 --> 38:41.170
But this plan

38:41.190 --> 38:42.740
needs this little disciple.

38:44.230 --> 38:45.010
You

38:45.510 --> 38:46.380
have a plan?

38:48.760 --> 38:50.050
He has a plan.

38:52.400 --> 38:53.380
Really?

38:53.580 --> 38:57.620
[Void Forbidden Land]

38:57.700 --> 39:00.740
[Forbidden]

39:11.540 --> 39:13.380
[Forbidden]

39:29.440 --> 39:31.340
The Sea-Calming Pillar is indeed here.

39:32.960 --> 39:35.380
This little rascal
finally told the truth.

39:42.400 --> 39:44.610
The Primordial Vessel can't budge it.

39:45.400 --> 39:46.170
Could it be

39:46.190 --> 39:48.490
that it really has the karma he said?

39:58.000 --> 39:58.780
What's this?

40:07.190 --> 40:09.050
Fairy, please show mercy!

40:09.150 --> 40:10.010
Fairy.

40:14.440 --> 40:16.900
I was wrong to deceive you, Fairy.

40:17.030 --> 40:18.050
But, Fairy,

40:18.070 --> 40:20.650
you burned my Lotus Hall

40:20.880 --> 40:23.740
and destroyed thousands of my treasures.

40:23.760 --> 40:25.610
That should've made up for it.

40:26.030 --> 40:27.090
How about this?

40:27.510 --> 40:29.210
Let's both compromise.

40:29.230 --> 40:31.090
Let's wipe the slate clean.

40:31.110 --> 40:32.340
How does that sound?

40:33.440 --> 40:34.650
Then how about this?

40:34.800 --> 40:36.860
We both take a step forward.

40:37.000 --> 40:38.650
Lend me the Sea-Calming Pillar.

40:38.670 --> 40:40.170
Once I finish my task,

40:40.190 --> 40:41.460
I'll come to be bound and punished.

40:41.480 --> 40:42.260
How's that?

40:44.760 --> 40:45.460
Okay.

40:45.920 --> 40:46.490
Okay.

40:47.030 --> 40:48.130
So, you agree?

40:49.110 --> 40:50.420
But it's a pity.

40:50.440 --> 40:51.610
Good as it is,

40:51.630 --> 40:53.210
it's not feasible.

40:54.070 --> 40:57.050
The Eye of the Sea is thick with miasma.

40:57.070 --> 41:00.300
Only the Pillar can quell it.

41:00.320 --> 41:01.740
So, you refuse.

41:08.920 --> 41:10.460
Aside from the Primordial Vessel,

41:11.190 --> 41:13.690
you've also got

41:14.280 --> 41:16.010
Cloudlink Hermit's Fiendscour Mirror,

41:16.030 --> 41:18.300
Crimson Spirit's Tideflame Edge,

41:18.550 --> 41:22.010
and Virtue Lord's Soulgore Nail.

41:22.800 --> 41:25.050
I have heard that lately,

41:25.150 --> 41:28.170
you've changed, making enemies.

41:28.510 --> 41:31.610
Even your Seizing Sect fellows
are baffled.

41:31.630 --> 41:34.210
So, the rumors are true after all.

41:39.000 --> 41:40.090
Beneath this Eye of the Sea,

41:40.230 --> 41:41.900
what dire beast is sealed below?

41:42.150 --> 41:43.780
What dire beast?

41:43.800 --> 41:44.940
Did you not hear

41:45.110 --> 41:45.860
that cry just now?

41:45.880 --> 41:47.010
I heard nothing.

41:48.630 --> 41:49.860
The realms of the fleeting world

41:50.230 --> 41:52.300
are filled with mad pretenders.

41:54.000 --> 41:55.170
Pregenesis Sword.

41:55.320 --> 41:56.210
What did you say?

41:56.630 --> 41:58.650
Back then, the Grand Mage of Voidcity

41:58.800 --> 42:00.460
set down this Sea-Calming Pillar

42:00.480 --> 42:02.340
to seal the East Sea's Eye.

42:02.710 --> 42:04.340
The Grand Mage's power

42:05.000 --> 42:08.210
surpasses yours.

42:08.230 --> 42:10.530
So, you can't break this seal

42:10.550 --> 42:12.740
or take the Sea-Calming Pillar.

42:14.000 --> 42:15.170
But the Pregenesis Sword can?

42:15.190 --> 42:16.010
That's right.

42:16.030 --> 42:17.210
The Pregenesis Sword

42:17.230 --> 42:20.650
is the only magic instrument
to break the seal.

42:54.840 --> 43:00.620
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

43:01.290 --> 43:07.990
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

43:09.520 --> 43:15.570
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

43:16.200 --> 43:22.650
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

43:23.390 --> 43:30.510
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:30.890 --> 43:37.790
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:38.170 --> 43:45.520
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

43:45.520 --> 43:52.690
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

44:08.830 --> 44:14.000
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

44:15.090 --> 44:22.110
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

44:23.300 --> 44:29.240
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

44:29.940 --> 44:37.020
♪Alas, our story is short♪

44:37.360 --> 44:44.470
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

44:44.790 --> 44:51.270
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

44:52.050 --> 44:59.260
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

44:59.650 --> 45:07.470
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
